  "description": "Teiko’s fearless motivation for cold hard cash leads him to a brush with death, awakening powerful Morale within him. This supernatural Morale makes him a recruit for the Anti-Depressers, an organization fighting monstrous Killjoys born from negative human emotions. When a mysterious group starts turning people in Killjoys, Teiko and his unorthodox team must battle to protect the innocent and uncover a conspiracy that runs deep. But Teiko’s fate is a little different: his strength may be more Killjoy than human!",
